Add the shared shapes a plain-language plan is built from

Adds the shared building blocks for the plain-language Start work flow. A new start-work module holds the feature-local origin kind 'start_work' (deliberately kept out of ISSUE_ORIGIN_KINDS and out of the client-declarable origin schema, following the email handoff pattern), the twelve-task cap, and the interaction idempotency key helper. A new stripDashes text helper replaces em and en dashes with a comma and space, collapsing any doubled space, so model-written text can be cleaned at the one point it enters the database. New validators describe the plan request body, the exact JSON the planner model must return (no way to express hidden tasks, labels, project or user assignees), and the plan route's response body. All are exported from the shared index next to the email handoff exports, and the shared package is rebuilt so server and ui see them. Note for the orchestrator: git status also shows packages/plugins/sdk/src/protocol.ts, server/src/routes/plugins.ts and server/src/__tests__/plugin-routes-authz.test.ts modified; those were not in the starting snapshot and are another session's plugin-route work, untouched by this item.

